Description: Deye hybrid inverter monitor over a Solarman WiFi logger
 solarman_bridge polls a Deye three-phase hybrid inverter through its
 Solarman / IGEN WiFi data logger (Solarman V5 protocol, TCP port 8899),
 keeps a history of PV, battery, grid and load telemetry plus the inverter's
 daily energy counters in SQLite, and serves a web dashboard with realtime
 values, history charts and monthly energy statistics.
